{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1062822/block/singleImage/3262170/df/01M6ZT4QF8HDKERTEDK19Z9V0G.jpeg?updatedAt=1794216458\"/><p>深水埗發生鋁窗搖搖欲墜事件。 今日（9日）下午1時許，深水埗青山道128號威利商業大廈有一扇鋁窗搖搖欲墜，保安員恐有墮下危險，於是報警。警方接報後到場，發現大廈一個單位的一扇鋁窗幾乎懸在半空，隨時有飛墮街頭之虞，隨即圍封大廈對開一段行人路以策安全。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:42:03.729188+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T09:27:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T15:15:50.362736+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T10:35:53.372114+00:00","content_hash":"aee80217d9231ddbe06b33f49b6560d09fe89b6bac67f284c2699eedc37c694a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:42:03.729188+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}